        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion TB-B2, Round Mount Towel Bar</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Traditional Round Mount Towel Bar is a stunning example of rustic decor and how it can add both a richness and a luster to a room. This wall mounted towel bar is available in 18 inch, 24 inch, and 30 inch lengths. Choose from antique pewter, antique copper, or oil rubbed bronze finishes. It is easy to install and comes packaged with all the necessary mounting hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: \r\n<a href=\"/products/traditional-round-mount-wall-mounted-towel-ring-fusion-tr-b2\"><b>Fusion TR-B2 Traditional Round Mount Towel Ring</b></a>, \r\n<a href=\"/products/traditional-round-mount-robe-hook-fusion-rh-b2\"><b>Fusion RH-B2 Traditional Round Mount Robe Hook</b></a>, and\r\n<a href=\"/products/traditional-round-mount-toilet-paper-roll-holder-fusion-ph-b2\"><b>Fusion PH-B2 Traditional Round Mount Toilet Paper Holder</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>TB-1-B2</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Diameter: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<b>TB-2-B2</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Diameter: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<b>TB-3-B2</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 30\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Diameter: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
